# macOS custom-folder-icon files. Google Drive sets a custom icon on every
# folder it syncs, and macOS stores that as a file literally named "Icon\r"
# (Icon + carriage return) whose image lives in a resource fork - so git sees
# a 0-byte file and happily commits it. 15 were already tracked.
